Dear Brent,

=20

Thank you for your reply.

=20

Please can you answer the following questions:

=20
What is the process if the judgment is inconsistent with the transcripts of=
 the trial?=20
What is the process if the factual evidence from the transcripts and testim=
onies directly contradicts the judgement?
=20

You are not authorized to lodge the typographical amendments until you hear=
 from the court and from me. I intend to contact the judge and explain why. =
I intend to appeal.

=20

Please explain to me the following instructions from the judge and their im=
plication for my case.

=20

=E2=80=9CWhen submitting their corrections, the parties should be mindful of the =
decision of the Court

of Appeal in Re I (Children: Fact Finding: Clarification of Judgment) [2019=
] EWCA Civ 898,

[2019] 2 FLR 887 paras [33] to [41] and Mostyn J in Olga Cazalet v Walid Ab=
u-Zalaf [2022]

EWFC 119 at [63].

This judgment will be handed down on 18 April 2024 with no attendance requi=
red.=E2=80=9D

=20

With kind wishes,

Nadia

=20

=20

=20

BV20D01752

Fraud Unravels All=20

